     A*****************************************************************
     A**   GENERIC PROVIDER FILE                                     **
     A**                                                             **
     A**             *----------------------------*                  **
     A**             | COMPILE WITH REUSEDLT=*YES |                  **
     A**             *----------------------------*                  **
     A**                                                             **
     A**   This file is used to control the assignment of non PDS    **
     A**   provider data to the PDS data base. Records in this file  **
     A**   are grouped by a 5 position vendor code and are tied      **
     A**   back to records in an uploaded vendor data base file by   **
     A**   a unique 15 digit generic sequence number. The assignment **
     A**   of these records to the PDS data base is done by program  **
     A**   N0095R and a vendor specific assignment program. When     **
     A**   assignment is made, the assigned record is deleted from   **
     A**   this file.                                                **
     A**                                                             **
     A**   PROGRAMMER: C:31                                          **
     A**   CREATED: 03/06/97         PROJECT: 87MBQ                  **
     A*****************************************************************
     A** REVISIONS:                                                  **
     A*****************************************************************
     A**
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PGP01                     TEXT('GENERIC PROVIDER FILE')
     A            GPVNCD         5          TEXT('VENDOR CODE')
     A            GPDTYP         1          TEXT('DATA TYPE')
     A*                                            H = History/Initial load
     A*                                            U = Update
     A*                                        blank = Other
     A            GPFEIN         9          TEXT('FEIN')
     A            GPIDNR        15          TEXT('ID NUMBER')
     A            GPFNME        35          TEXT('FACILITY NAME')
     A            GPNAME        35          TEXT('PROVIDER NAME')
     A            GPTYPE         6          TEXT('PROVIDER TYPE')
     A            GPSPEC         6          TEXT('PROVIDER SPECIALITY')
     A            GPADR1        30          TEXT('PRACTICE STREET ADDRESS')
     A            GPCITY        20          TEXT('PRACTICE CITY')
     A            GPST           2          TEXT('PRACTICE STATE')
     A            GPZIP         10          TEXT('PRACTICE ZIP CODE')
     A            GPBILL        55          TEXT('BILLING ADDRESS')
     A            GPGSEQ        15P 0       TEXT('GENERIC SEQUENCE #')
     A            GPIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL USER')
     A            GPIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL PGM')
     A            GPITIM    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL TIME')
     A            GPIDT     R               REFFLD(DT7)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL DATE')
